    "notes": "All 10 final portable views inspected. Complete principal curved shell, low wide genuinely recessed entrance, closed reed ceiling/jamb reveals and dark timber/reed backing, sparse supports, earthen floor, tiny plain apex cap/finial and geometric lower hanging bundles. No missing principal roof or unintended see-through hole was observed. Turntables expose the deliberately buried foundation; this is not an above-ground cylindrical building. The source is an original picture-proportioned exterior. Independent gate, drum-house and surrounding site remain native; interiors and royal graves are outside scope."
